{
  "title": "Quaint Croatian Red Pepper Skewers",
  "description": "A crunchy and energizing Croatian dish featuring red pepper and nuka-pickle, perfect for a snack or light meal. This shojin-friendly recipe is easy to make and delicious to eat.",
  "cuisine": "Croatian",
